  "prefLabel": "Res 5302.09 Waiting Period",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Res 5302.09 Waiting Period. No additional trees shall be removed from applicable areas for 12 months following the removal of up to 50 percent of the basal area of healthy growing trees within the applicable areas. The 12 month period shall begin on the date of report of timber cut required by RSA 79:11. If no report of cut is required, the 12 month period shall begin upon completion of harvest operation.\n\nSource. #8441, eff 10-1-05; ss by #10547, eff 3-21-14 (from Res 5302.10)",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/res5200-5900.html"
